Sun Oct 25 18:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Preset: enable joycond.service

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 21 08:30:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- BBRv3 was never used on kernel-nazoos: tcp_bbr (loaded via
  modules-load.d, also in the initrd) and tcp_bbr3 register the same
  BPF kfunc names, so tcp_bbr3 failed to load. The congestion control
  is now set by nazoos-tcp-bbr.service (bbr) and
  nazoos-tcp-bbr3.service (bbr3, only on *-nazoos kernels) instead of
  sysctl.d and modules-load.d; the initrd is regenerated once

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Oct 20 07:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Polkit rule 49-nazoos-fwupd-refresh.rules: fwupd-refresh.service
  failed with "Failed to obtain auth" whenever new LVFS metadata was
  available, because openSUSE's 90-default-privs.rules runs before
  fwupd's own rule and asks for the admin password

-------------------------------------------------------------------
