- Timer nazoos-xone-firmware: downloads the Xbox wireless dongle
  firmware once the system is online (the install script of
  xone-dongle-firmware has no network in the OBS image build);
  retries hourly while a file is missing
- Preset: enable fwupd-refresh.timer (firmware metadata for fwupd
  and Discover)

