Wed Oct  7 20:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Performance tweaks:
  * MGLRU min_ttl_ms=1000 via tmpfiles.d (protects the working set)
  * Larger Mesa and Nvidia shader caches via environment.d
  * GameMode defaults in /etc/gamemode.ini (renice, ioprio,
    softrealtime, inhibit screensaver)

